  "updated_at": "2026-04-03",
  "bio": "Robson Assis Fig, based in Goiânia, Brazil, is renowned for his fineline and sketch-style tattoos. His meticulous attention to detail, coupled with his mastery in these unique styles, exhibit the high skill level of this artist. His work evidently speaks for his belief that \"Art exists because life alone is not enough\".\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Goiânia, Goias, Brazil"
